      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.94,
      "end_seconds": 344.35,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "Keep the nails short and keep using the moisturiser. Let's plan a check in one week. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
